        ### Interrupts (Cortex-A7 GIC interrupt IDs, data sheet Table 3-8)

        | # | Source | # | Source | # | Source |
        |---|---|---|---|---|---|
        | 0-31 | For A7 internal use | 53 | USB_EHCI | 75 | VEDU (265) |
