        | 35 | Timer01 | 57 | GSF | 79 | GPIO0 |
        | 36 | Timer23 | 58 | Cipher | 80 | GPIO1 |
        | 37 | DMAC | 59 | Reserved | 81 | GPIO2/ GPIO15 |
