        | 39 | RTC | 61 | Reserved | 83 | GPIO4/ GPIO13 |
        | 40 | UART0 | 62 | Reserved | 84 | GPIO5/ GPIO12 |
        | 41 | UART1 | 63 | Reserved | 85 | GPIO6/ GPIO11 |
