        | 43 | UART3 | 65 | VDP | 87 | GPIO8/ GPIO9 |
        | 44 | SSP0 | 66 | MIPI | 88 | tem_cap_int |
        | 45 | SSP1 | 67 | VICAP | 89 | I2C1 |
        | 46 | I2C | 68 | VPSS | 90 | I2C2 |
        | 47 | IR | 69 | TDE | 91 | Reserved |
        | 48 | SAR_ADC | 70 | VGS | 92 | Reserved |
        | 49 | SFC_NOR | 71 | AIO | 93 | Reserved |
