        | 52 | SDIO1 | 74 | Reserved |  |  |

        ### Clock-gate and reset map (generated from the CRG registers)

        | Offset | Register | Description | Gate / reset fields |
        |---|---|---|---|
        | 0x02C | PERI_CRG11 | VICAP and MIPI CTRL clock and reset configuration register | vi_cken, vi_srst_req, vi_hrst_req, mipi_srst_req, isp_core_srst_req, isp_cfg_srst_req, sensor_cken, sensor_srst_req |
        | 0x034 | PERI_CRG13 | VOU clock and reset control register | vo_srst_req, vo_cfg_cken, vo_ppc_cken, vo_pcken, vo_out_cken, vou_acken, vou_hd_cken, vou_sd_cken, dac_cken |
        | 0x038 | PERI_CRG14 | PWM clock and reset control register | pwm_srst_req, pwm_cken |
        | 0x040 | PERI_CRG16 | VEDU clock and soft reset control register | vedu_srst_req, vedu_cken, avc_srst_req, avc_cken |
        | 0x048 | PERI_CRG18 | VPSS clock and reset control register | vps_srst_req, vps_cken |
        | 0x058 | PERI_CRG22 | TDE clock and soft reset control register | tde_srst_req, tde_cken |
        | 0x05C | PERI_CRG23 | VGS clock and soft reset control register | vgs_srst_req, vgs_cken |
        | 0x060 | PERI_CRG24 | JPGE clock and soft reset control register | jpge_srst_req, jpge_cken |
        | 0x068 | PERI_CRG26 | MDU clock and soft reset control register | mdu_srst_req, mdu_cken |
        | 0x06C | PERI_CRG27 | IVE clock and soft reset control register | ive_srst_req, ive_cken |
        | 0x07C | PERI_CRG31 | SAR_ADC and cipher clock and soft reset control register | cipher_srst_req, cipher_cken, sar_adc_srst_req |
        | 0x08C | PERI_CRG35 | AIO clock and soft reset control register | aio_srst_req, aiao_cken |
        | 0x0B8 | PERI_CRG46 | USB clock and soft reset control register | usb_ahb_srst_req, usb_cken, usb_device_ctrl_srst_req |
        | 0x0C0 | PERI_CRG48 | SFC clock and soft reset control register | sfc_srst_req, sfc_cken, sfc_nand_srst_req, sfc_nand_cken |
        | 0x0C4 | PERI_CRG49 | SDIO0/SDIO1 clock and soft reset control register | sdio0_srst_req, sdio0_cken, sdio1_srst_req, sdio1_cken |
        | 0x0CC | PERI_CRG51 | GSF/GMAC/FE PHY clock and soft reset control register | gsf_srst_req, gsf_cken, gmac_if_srst_req, gmac_if_cken |
        | 0x0D0 | PERI_CRG52 | NANDC clock and soft reset control register | nfc_srst_req, nfc_cken |
        | 0x0D8 | PERI_CRG54 | DMA/DDRTEST/eFUSE clock and soft reset control register | efuse_srst_req, efuse_cken, ddrtest_srst_req, ddrtest_cken, dma_srst_req, dma_cken |
        | 0x0E4 | PERI_CRG57 | Soft reset control register for other CRG interface modules | test_clk_en, i2c_srst_req, tcap_srst_req, ir_srst_req, ssp0_srst_req, ssp1_srst_req, uart0_srst_req, uart1_srst_req, uart2_srst_req, uart3_srst_req, ... |
        | 0x10C | PERI_CRG67 | BPLL spread spectrum configuration register | bpll_ssmod_cken, bpll_ssmod_rst_req |
        | 0x110 | PERI_CRG68 | VPLL spread spectrum configuration register | vpll_ssmod_cken, vpll_ssmod_rst_req |
        | 0x118 | PERI_CRG70 | EPLL spread spectrum configuration register | epll_ssmod_cken, epll_ssmod_rst_req |
        | 0x12C | PERI_CRG75 | Core high performance monitor | core_hpm_en, core_hpm_monitor_en, core_hpm_srst_req |

        Only fields whose names contain a clock-enable or reset keyword are listed; the field descriptions in the register pages give the polarity and the clocks they gate.

